# Agent ops

Default role: **Orchestrator**. If the user names coordinator, planner, design engineer, software engineer, schema engineer, orchestrator, or verifier, read `.cursor/skills/<role>/SKILL.md` and follow it.

Before planning or implementing a feature, read:

- `.cursor/agents/PROTOCOL.md`
- `.cursor/agents/STATUS.md`
- `.cursor/agents/PIPELINE.md`

Handoffs live in `.cursor/agents/inbox/`. Do not invent architecture in prompts. Do not implement when the user asked for a brief, spec, work plan, or prompt.
